			cfg float64	 classifier-free guidance scale over the null prompt (empty = 1 = H3's released sampler); adapters de-distill H3, so adapter rows use > 1
			prompt_set string	 The h3_eval_prompts set it runs on (empty = main); plan pairs a model only with the prompts of its set (m00972)
