			size int64	 The side in pixels (empty = 512); Alpha Video v2 rows (manifest §23) use 768
			layout string	 grid2x2 = split v3-grid: the frame is 2 x 2 panels (gray, white / black, alpha), post-processed by h3magic/grid.py; empty = one image
