						lpips_vs_full @	      float  From scores.json rows, or empty                                                  0.165

	 LATENT COMPOSITOR (manifest §24). Run: fish data/run_proc_latentcomp.fish (CPU only). It runs lc_find every time, then imports each new
	 or changed shard and candidate. lc_shards and lc_methods rows are claimed one at a time ($SAMPLE)

	lc_find	 Finds the dataset shards and the scored candidates in LC_DIR: one lc_shards row per shard, one lc_methods row per candidate. Reads small files only
		query SELECT job_id FROM lc_jobs WHERE lc_find_claim IS NULL
